---

Note on inputs: this repository caches responses from NASA POWER (public domain,
U.S. Government work) and derives features from Sentinel-1 RTC and Landsat
Collection 2 Level-2 imagery accessed via the Microsoft Planetary Computer.
Those data products carry their own terms from their respective providers
(ESA / Copernicus, USGS/NASA, Microsoft). Outbreak labels are derived from
published literature cited in `data/raw_literature/` and the README.
